### `src/models/Connection.js`
Manages relationships between users. Supports pending, accepted,
and declined states.

**Fields:**
| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `id` | Number | Auto-incrementing unique ID |
| `requesterId` | Number | ID of the user who sent the request |
| `receiverId` | Number | ID of the user who received the request |
| `status` | String | `pending`, `accepted`, or `declined` |
| `message` | String | Optional note sent with the request |
| `createdAt` | Date | When the request was sent |

**Methods:**
| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `findAll()` | Returns all connections |
| `findByUser(userId)` | Returns all connections a user is part of |
| `findAccepted(userId)` | Returns only accepted connections |
| `findPending(userId)` | Returns only incoming pending requests |
| `findBetween(a, b)` | Checks if two users are already connected |
| `create(requesterId, receiverId, message)` | Sends a new request |
| `updateStatus(id, status)` | Accepts or declines a request |
| `delete(id)` | Removes a connection entirely |

