## API Quick Reference

### Auth
```
POST   /api/auth/register     Create a new account
POST   /api/auth/login        Log in and get a token
GET    /api/auth/me           Get the current logged in user
```

### Users
```
GET    /api/users             List all users / smart search
GET    /api/users/:id         Get a single profile
PATCH  /api/users/:id         Update your profile
DELETE /api/users/:id         Delete your account
```

### Connections
```
GET    /api/connections             All my connections
GET    /api/connections/accepted    My active network
GET    /api/connections/pending     Incoming requests
POST   /api/connections/:id         Send a request
PATCH  /api/connections/:id         Accept or decline
DELETE /api/connections/:id         Remove a connection
```

